 "plan": {
  "name": "Suraksha Health Gold",
  "scope_note": "Models one retail-style health policy. Product filing is not modelled. The IRDAI Master Circular on Health Insurance Business (29 May 2024) sets the 1-hour cashless and 3-hour discharge decisions. It has no clause on proportionate deduction, so the policy wording governs which charges it reaches."
